---
/*
 * Lesson 0.2: how a residual-current device (DR) works. Phase and neutral
 * pass through the same magnetic ring; while the currents are equal the ring
 * sees nothing. A leak through a person makes them differ, the sensing coil
 * feels it and the trip opens both contacts.
 */
import Figure from '../../../components/Figure.astro';
---

<Figure
  wide
  alt="Esquema de um DR: a fase e o neutro passam juntos por dentro de um anel magnético. Uma bobina enrolada no anel está ligada ao disparador, que abre os contatos. Depois do DR há um chuveiro; uma pessoa encosta na carcaça e parte da corrente desce pelo corpo até a terra."
  caption="Como o DR percebe o choque. A fase e o neutro atravessam o mesmo anel. Se toda a corrente que vai pela fase volta pelo neutro, os efeitos se cancelam. Se uma parte escapa pela pessoa para a terra, sobra uma diferença; a bobina sente e o disparador abre o circuito."
>
  <svg
    class="fig-dr"
    viewBox="0 0 660 300"
    width="660"
    height="300"
    fill="none"
    stroke-linecap="round"
    stroke-linejoin="round"
    font-family="var(--font-sans)"
    font-size="13"
  >
    <!-- DR enclosure -->
    <rect
      x="70"
      y="22"
      width="250"
      height="230"
      rx="12"
      class="fig-dr__box"
      stroke-width="1.5"
      stroke-dasharray="6 5"
    ></rect>
    <text x="84" y="44" class="fig-dr__title">
      DR
    </text>

    <!-- Phase and neutral lines -->
    <path d="M10 80H112M134 80H520" class="fig-dr__fase" stroke-width="3"></path>
    <path d="M10 140H112M134 140H520" class="fig-dr__neutro" stroke-width="3"></path>
    <text x="12" y="70" class="fig-dr__label fig-dr__fase-t">
      Fase
    </text>
    <text x="12" y="160" class="fig-dr__label fig-dr__neutro-t">
      Neutro
    </text>

    <!-- Contacts (closed) -->
    <path d="M112 80l22-10M112 140l22-10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"></path>
    <circle cx="112" cy="80" r="3" fill="currentColor"></circle>
    <circle cx="112" cy="140" r="3" fill="currentColor"></circle>
    <circle cx="134" cy="80" r="3" fill="currentColor"></circle>
    <circle cx="134" cy="140" r="3" fill="currentColor"></circle>
    <text x="98" y="112" class="fig-dr__small">
      contatos
    </text>

    <!-- Magnetic ring around both wires -->
    <ellipse cx="205" cy="110" rx="24" ry="56" class="fig-dr__ring" stroke-width="9"></ellipse>
    <text x="205" y="44" text-anchor="middle" class="fig-dr__small">
      anel magnético
    </text>

    <!-- Sensing coil and trip -->
    <path
      d="M190 163c6 6 10 6 15 0M190 170c6 6 10 6 15 0M190 177c6 6 10 6 15 0"
      stroke="currentColor"
      stroke-width="2"
    ></path>
    <path d="M205 180v30h33" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path>
    <rect
      x="238"
      y="196"
      width="78"
      height="30"
      rx="6"
      stroke="currentColor"
      stroke-width="1.5"
    ></rect>
    <text x="278" y="215" text-anchor="middle" class="fig-dr__small">
      disparador
    </text>
    <path
      d="M238 211H123V150"
      stroke="currentColor"
      stroke-width="1.5"
      stroke-dasharray="4 4"
      marker-end="url(#fig-dr-arrow)"
    ></path>
    <text x="138" y="235" class="fig-dr__small">
      bobina sensora
    </text>

    <!-- Load: shower with metal case -->
    <rect
      x="470"
      y="60"
      width="110"
      height="100"
      rx="10"
      class="fig-dr__case"
      stroke-width="2"
    ></rect>
    <path d="M520 80v20l8 6-16 8 16 8-16 8 8 6v4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"></path>
    <text x="525" y="182" text-anchor="middle" class="fig-dr__label">
      Chuveiro
    </text>

    <!-- Leak through a person to earth -->
    <circle cx="616" cy="166" r="9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"></circle>
    <path
      d="M616 175v46M616 186l-31-34M616 186l14 20M616 221l-10 30M616 221l10 30"
      stroke="currentColor"
      stroke-width="2.5"
    ></path>
    <path d="M592 258h48M599 264h34M607 270h18" class="fig-dr__terra" stroke-width="2"></path>
    <path
      d="M590 136c44 4 58 40 52 80s-14 30-22 34"
      class="fig-dr__fuga"
      stroke-width="2.5"
      stroke-dasharray="3 6"
      marker-end="url(#fig-dr-arrow-fuga)"
    ></path>
    <text x="588" y="290" text-anchor="end" class="fig-dr__small fig-dr__fuga-t">
      fuga pela pessoa
    </text>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="fig-dr-arrow"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto-start-reverse"
      >
        <path d="M0 0L10 5L0 10z" fill="currentColor"></path>
      </marker>
      <marker
        id="fig-dr-arrow-fuga"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto-start-reverse"
      >
        <path d="M0 0L10 5L0 10z" class="fig-dr__fuga-fill"></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>
  </svg>
</Figure>

<style>
  .fig-dr {
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  .fig-dr text {
    fill: currentColor;
    stroke: none;
  }

  .fig-dr__box {
    stroke: var(--fg-subtle);
  }

  .fig-dr__title {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  .fig-dr__label {
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .fig-dr__small {
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .fig-dr__fase {
    stroke: var(--danger);
  }

  .fig-dr text.fig-dr__fase-t {
    fill: var(--danger);
  }

  .fig-dr__neutro {
    stroke: var(--accent);
  }

  .fig-dr text.fig-dr__neutro-t {
    fill: var(--accent);
  }

  .fig-dr__ring {
    stroke: color-mix(in oklab, var(--fg-subtle) 55%, transparent);
  }

  .fig-dr__case {
    stroke: var(--fg-muted);
  }

  .fig-dr__fuga {
    stroke: var(--warning);
  }

  .fig-dr__fuga-fill {
    fill: var(--warning);
  }

  .fig-dr text.fig-dr__fuga-t {
    fill: var(--warning);
  }

  .fig-dr__terra {
    stroke: var(--success);
  }
</style>
